      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.4,
      "end_seconds": 284.75,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with a significant paracetamol overdose needing urgent treatment at this stage."
